Third-party components
----------------------
None bundled. The app is written against Apple system frameworks
(AVFoundation, CryptoKit, Security, SwiftUI, UIKit) which ship with iOS
and are not redistributed here.

The diagrams in assets/ are hand-authored SVG using the reader's system
font stack; no font files are embedded or redistributed.
